  "remarks": "Upravlyayushchaya Kompaniya UZTM KARTEKS is a leading manufacturer of equipment for the mining, construction, energy and metallurgy industries. It manages Uralmashplant OJSC and IZ-KARTEX named after P.G. Korobkov Ltd. The mining and metallurgy sectors provide a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation.",
